  }, {
    "tStartMs": 505490,
    "dDurationMs": 6989,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, that's a a big risk. I mean you obviously\nneed the compressed air for your structure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 512479,
    "dDurationMs": 9370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so if you have a leak. Oh. Then you don't\nhave a robot, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521849,
    "dDurationMs": 3970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's a pretty big drawback of soft robots."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525819,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You know, some things that you could do\nto mitigate that would be to have onboard"
