  }, {
    "tStartMs": 546389,
    "dDurationMs": 5950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or a picture. I think most people's conception\nof soft robots was really expanded by the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 552339,
    "dDurationMs": 5470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "movie Big Hero 6. And I think they did a great\njob in kind of showcasing what a soft robot"
